	"name": "Final Judgement",
	"type": "maneuver",
	"img": "icons/magic/symbols/runes-etched-steel-blade.webp",
	"system": {
		"description": "<p>With a final, decisive, strike, justice is fulfilled. As an action, you make a melee weapon attack against a target who must be bloodied. If they are under the effects of one of your brands or judgements, this attack roll is made with advantage. Your damage this attack is Radiant and your target must succeed at a Charisma saving throw or take an additional 10d6 radiant damage. On a successful save, the target takes half damage. A creature cannot be targeted by this maneuver again for 24 hours.</p>",
